Summary of modifications
================================================================================

Changes made to the original Markor source by PIXEL-PEN include:

  - Added a Calendar Input module for creating date-stamped notes into a
    Year / Month / Category folder structure.
  - Added a Folder Tree browser presenting notes in creation chronology.
  - Added creation-time tracking (CreationIndex, NoteTimestamp) so that notes
    sort by when they were created rather than when they were last modified.
  - Added category management.
  - Changed the application id and Java package from net.gsantner.markor to
    net.pixelpen.journal.
  - Removed all product flavors.
  - Various bug fixes to the above and to inherited code.

The upstream Markor codebase remains under net.gsantner.opoc (the project's
portable utility package) and is unmodified in substance.

